Without this patch when -pthreads is useed, _REENTRANT is not set.

diff --git a/tools/clang/lib/Driver/ToolChains/Clang.cpp b/tools/clang/lib/Driver/ToolChains/Clang.cpp
index 1976b48..7132a10 100644
